              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["bills", "switch"]
            },
            "description": "Switch bills or create new bill. Uses branchId and posId from session (set at login). If targetBillId is not provided or empty: creates a new bill. If targetBillId is provided: switches to that bill (holds current 'new' bill, resumes target). Backend automatically finds and holds the current 'new' bill for the same POS. Returns full bill details. Requires 'bills:write' permission."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
